WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.956 --> 00:00:03.592
WARRANTS, THAT IS A -- THAT --

00:00:02.691 --> 00:00:05.060
IT'S ON A LINE.

00:00:03.726 --> 00:00:06.395
YOU'RE RIGHT.

00:00:05.194 --> 00:00:08.264
WE SHOULDN'T JUST BLOW TO THE

00:00:06.528 --> 00:00:10.199
CRIME WAS COMMITTED HERE.

00:00:08.397 --> 00:00:12.234
JOINING US ON THE PHONE, GEORGE

00:00:10.332 --> 00:00:14.436
WASHINGTON UNIVERSITY PROFESSOR,

00:00:12.368 --> 00:00:15.971
JONATHAN TURLEY WHO HAS BEEN

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:19.375
WATCHING THESE EVENTS UNFOLD.

00:00:16.105 --> 00:00:22.578
YOUR REACTION TO THE FIRING OF

00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:24.680
ANDREW McCABE, TWO DAYS BEFORE

00:00:22.711 --> 00:00:26.515
HIS 50th BIRTHDAY WHERE HIS

00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:26.882
PENSION WOULD HAVE KICKED IN.

00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:29.151
PROFESSOR?

00:00:27.016 --> 00:00:29.551
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT SURPRISED BY THE

00:00:29.285 --> 00:00:31.153
DECISION.

00:00:29.685 --> 00:00:32.621
SOME OF US SAID IT WOULD BE

00:00:31.287 --> 00:00:35.791
LIKELY THAT HE WOULD BE FIRED.

00:00:32.755 --> 00:00:38.060
THE REASON IS THAT THIS IS AN

00:00:35.925 --> 00:00:41.063
EXCEEDINGLY RARE RECOMMENDATION

00:00:38.193 --> 00:00:42.598
COMING FROM THE OFFICE OF

00:00:41.196 --> 00:00:44.300
PROFESSIONAL RESPONSIBILITY.

00:00:42.731 --> 00:00:46.302
IT'S VIRTUALLY UNHEARD OF FOR

00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:47.770
SOMEONE THAT HELD THE POSITION

00:00:46.435 --> 00:00:50.039
OF McCABE.

00:00:47.903 --> 00:00:51.740
SO IT WAS VERY UNLIKELY IN MAY

00:00:50.172 --> 00:00:53.809
VIEW THAT JEFF SESSIONS WOULD

00:00:51.874 --> 00:00:55.978
NOT FOLLOW THAT CAREER ADVICE.

00:00:53.943 --> 00:00:56.845
HE FOLLOWED THAT ADVICE IN HIS

00:00:56.111 --> 00:00:58.981
OWN RECUSAL.

00:00:56.979 --> 00:01:01.884
HE YIELDED TO CAREER OFFICERS

00:00:59.114 --> 00:01:04.520
THAT HAD RECOMMENDED THAT

00:01:02.017 --> 00:01:06.555
COURSE.

00:01:04.653 --> 00:01:08.791
I'VE SAID BEFORE, I THOUGHT HE

00:01:06.689 --> 00:01:10.459
WOULD DO WHAT HE DID TONIGHT.

00:01:08.924 --> 00:01:12.795
WHAT IS A MORE DIFFICULT

00:01:10.592 --> 00:01:15.497
QUESTION THAT WILL BE PRESENTED

00:01:12.928 --> 00:01:17.566
FOR THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT IS

00:01:15.631 --> 00:01:20.636
HOW THEY WILL GO FROM HERE.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:24.306
BECAUSE THE SUGGESTION IS THAT

00:01:20.769 --> 00:01:27.376
THE INSPECTOR GENERAL FOUND THAT

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:28.844
McCABE INTENTIONALLY MISLEAD

00:01:27.509 --> 00:01:30.879
THEIR INVESTIGATORS.

00:01:28.978 --> 00:01:34.116
THAT'S ALMOST INDISTINGUISHABLE

00:01:31.013 --> 00:01:35.484
FROM WHAT THEY CHARGED MICHAEL

00:01:34.249 --> 00:01:36.652
FLYNN WITH.

00:01:35.617 --> 00:01:37.419
&gt;&gt; Laura: EXACTLY.

00:01:36.785 --> 00:01:39.154
A GOOD POINT.

00:01:37.553 --> 00:01:41.523
&gt;&gt; SO THE QUESTION ON THE TABLE

00:01:39.288 --> 00:01:44.760
HERE IS ONE OF CONTINUITY.

00:01:41.657 --> 00:01:46.161
FLYNN IS ACCUSED OF LYING ABOUT

00:01:44.893 --> 00:01:46.528
NOT THE MEETING WITH THE

00:01:46.295 --> 00:01:48.163
RUSSIANS.

00:01:46.662 --> 00:01:50.399
HE APPARENTLY ADMITTED THAT.

00:01:48.297 --> 00:01:52.234
BY TALKING ABOUT SANCTIONS.

00:01:50.532 --> 00:01:53.202
THE MEETING WITH THE RUSSIANS

00:01:52.368 --> 00:01:56.872
WAS NOT ILLEGAL.

00:01:53.335 --> 00:01:59.074
IN THIS CASE, McCABE IS ACCUSED

00:01:57.006 --> 00:02:00.976
OF MISLEADING INVESTIGATORS ON

00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:01.744
SOMETHING THAT WAS A VIOLATION

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:04.213
OF FEDERAL RULES.

00:02:01.877 --> 00:02:06.215
SO I THINK THE QUESTION WILL BE

00:02:04.346 --> 00:02:08.617
RAISED IS, WELL, IS THIS SIMPLY

00:02:06.348 --> 00:02:09.952
A MATTER OF A PENSION OR --

00:02:08.751 --> 00:02:11.520
BECAUSE FOR FLYNN, IT WAS A

00:02:10.085 --> 00:02:13.522
MATTER OF PRISON.

00:02:11.653 --> 00:02:13.922
&gt;&gt; Laura: CAN'T BE.

